description	"Ninja Footsoldier(staff)

^2Weaponry:
- Bo [Staff]
-- ^7Staff Style Only
-- Melee / Ranged Defense (1)

^8Attributes:
- Light Acrobatics [Stamina 3 + Dexterity 2]

^3Abilities:
- Thrown Metsubishi [Blind 1]
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]

An often used tactic of the ninja was to blind their adversaries, to use as a distraction or to gain the upper hand in a fight. Another traditional weapon of the ninja was the bo staff. It could be passed off as a walking stick and therefore easily conceilable."